  "body": "I display image by using base64 like below.\r\nex)\r\n'img src=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAUAAAAFCAYAAACNbyblAAAAHElEQVQI12P4\r\n        //8/w38GIAXDIBKE0DHxgljNBAAO9TXL0Y4OHwAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\" alt=\"Red dot\" /'\r\n\r\nBut I want to set ImageData(https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/ImageData/ImageData) directly because converting imagedata to base64 is heavy function.\r\nIs it possible to use ImageData directly like below??or is there any way?\r\n\r\n'img src=\"data:image/png;ImageData, imagedata\" alt=\"Red dot\" /'",
